{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9876a3fd3b98474b2308f53ba37dd808a5c8d68b17f163923cae1ed8694958cb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89631e76c9d2d5b44b984e2a1a44fa3f38a97b32f2e3fedba68f1e51b5db2ba5",
      "text": "偶然的再会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b8907a17821b4a4fe3749b45cf35e87a13874b804e1072abfa548c9800e089f",
      "text": "试镜当天。\n诚司与英雄在等候室等待时，\n龙在报到截止的最后一刻冲了进来。\n在彼此为重逢而欣喜的氛围中，众人聊到了\n龙为何会来参加试镜的话题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000021:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000021:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89631e76c9d2d5b44b984e2a1a44fa3f38a97b32f2e3fedba68f1e51b5db2ba5",
      "text": "偶然的再会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aec4a303a3cb9901a44f3f0633f939add26832897c220902583356c7f1eafb6",
      "text": "试镜会场报到处",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39f618dfa22bc54b3966f12bb3d325eba2223f3ba718e494a733e400de09de62",
      "text": "这里就是试镜会场吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2607874fb75f7e904d9c3bcbabc7210365304b25755ae6d431dd821ddd964cc3",
      "text": "总之，先坐着等就行了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da95c8ed77eda10b5eb6bb43bc24f0130d8cbd0f0aae1221abd11ce4d6d355c5",
      "text": "（唔，真不像我，居然紧张起来了。……好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27d514e36380989db7146bfa61e0621cb9b2ca4828de2a237f849f960fbb5fbb",
      "text": "距离试镜开始还有点时间，\n去外面稍微跑两步吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000066:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9ce7fd60506a3393c4fbfb7ba1f01a78c4a70c0a0f46249d355203dbec9e2e6",
      "text": "好的，这样报到手续就办好了。\n在试镜开始前，请在这里稍作等待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:414f8a99f5a7476bf2801b039fa0feb07d45b31a0a5f9e92c1205d5fc2e5a010",
      "text": "如果想要出去走走也是可以的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f957e0810d6cf93d6bfdfa3ff4084e6b90b26e8c72ce880a0b7fc1f40b1b3665",
      "text": "不用了，我就在这里等吧。\n谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d90aa1fce3cf5c3820b80ef73feca018edb3fc01583eb1521b5b64ef54110eb5",
      "text": "……糟了，好像开始紧张起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ada42d9fcab0a8ee3f8d982953e665f95225aadf575448d26a389c097651dd4",
      "text": "先找个地方坐下冷静一下吧。\n空座位在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aac3c12a33d0959ffac5670393253663b6910c64cb36e3a6c6c52d1073d7a6f",
      "text": "赶、赶上了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_a:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b7dbb8df6ecc13a4984d30002e68d0d2d677f3d5e6ba7ed09b81c7b80f62503",
      "text": "我是报名参加试镜的木村龙！\n现在还来得及吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4bb344b11b9c0db9baf259328577369cdba68bbd6b98cf34ad339fd967ccf26",
      "text": "勉强压哨通过哦！\n好的，木村龙先生。报到完成。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:405ee3acdab7a8211724fcb3f8ff9c455dfa6a4dd08ca2a74b56c3f2db74f235",
      "text": "谢、谢谢您……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:179f977e33196de3b58f414c300e285e8a844dafd6fc8b514fd4824af0f399d2",
      "text": "哈啊，哈啊……\n一路上遇到的红绿灯全是红灯，我还以为死定了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd1d02753498e272612b3bc3c894e9e66f1d0e719d6f9d440ac0a1e61783945",
      "text": "没事吧？\n来，不介意的话喝口水吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d621c6dbc37ef5b39cc7ece89964bfced913bdb8958dc5dfe2aca0a0969d6e8",
      "text": "谢谢……\n哇，脸好凶！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1ae0b0f6737e051eb8267026cb80e2183dc09f2f4d456d8450066563aec4ba4",
      "text": "哈、哈哈……经常有人这么说。\n抱歉啊，吓到你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98ef20fc1088b5a404a94c914cf03105e9f9741328a1e7435fc00f5dbdce21db",
      "text": "没、没有！初次见面就说了这么失礼的话，\n是我不好，实在对不起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0dd389784eef35a20f5297167b828ab9172a9d25cf66024849d1af47bb4fbf5",
      "text": "谢谢你的水！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e73152943139820db79105de89f6cedb4f9dc12369ce3523759999514261046e",
      "text": "噢，赶上了就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:005d5d6881df5cf3c91f49b8c81bb0b772167b2da39612d1ec67d496a843eadc",
      "text": "离开始好像还有一点时间，\n喝点水冷静一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_b:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d48104c0e490d1bd77c9aa7aa52d96052697c210d390c6949509bef1e4ce761e",
      "text": "……嗯？\n难道是，龙吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d7d84d6842684fed2eafdfbfc25ccca0b5a5daa819d4b21e7c9bcce0f4473b0",
      "text": "诚、诚司先生！？好久不见了！\n真没想到会在这里碰见您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7f722f6dae1a3673353640a7683158d721f0823f0f606f1c146eede7c71a38c",
      "text": "你们认识吗？那我回避一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea8daa5712bb8270ceae07c3fd12746d8ebf0364d7d901d4c732e670fbe3783e",
      "text": "不，倒不如说我能加入你们吗？\n我不太习惯这种场合。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05aa86aa10841533e96e2a746a70fc3ddc211e5efb56535c820083a8b8b08b64",
      "text": "哈哈，我也一样。\n刚才正紧张呢，有人能聊聊天真是帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:515d6c6c49db5a381c2c057045272d1ae97fb6383e16f0b7335352f06afbed1f",
      "text": "我是握野英雄。请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afcc4561006ccefe65559b3b020d30beec4447386e4eb1d67c640367073426b2",
      "text": "我是木村龙。请多指教！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f80f629179837c065d37e499f62e6b92c6a5a36903ca890dc56dd74a240a096b",
      "text": "我是信玄诚司。请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a787dfffc725555eb3e6d18715f89c6347d6c5db89d84922a85be969bd01036a",
      "text": "话说，你们两位是在哪里认识的？\n学生时代的前后辈之类的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0529edd5e20e64752b9b93012a5b9f0f290fa5d2efca5d3dcc23fb2c0d219567",
      "text": "不是，以前我还在自卫队的时候，\n在实弹演习场遇见过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0880bd0a8ecd5206a66fb55bafb57fe5e173f9d9060184e835a8c623b5f7f6f",
      "text": "当时发生了一起事故。\n碰巧在场的龙帮了我一把。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3a5de7f7fb8e9206612452b600b3a93a3aa776d55f93b56be8dd8f0d001e403",
      "text": "话说回来，我还以为你当上消防员了呢……\n怎么会在这里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcc9d8caadf08b41a8f3d0744e7a76305af8d01b5996c06b915c734443358567",
      "text": "消防员是当上了，可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9080637d5825bd8c2bb85e5ebccc6cc4f8aa63bf2fe43972dc8845bb38579046",
      "text": "几个月前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc4b57192f63e0799ad5764a70c699b8cf898992910ac59cfec1ae873cacd678",
      "text": "哇、哇啊啊啊！好痛痛痛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f7e53cf4fc98a87d6dbaaddf0cde6f5106c804924ba51db2f6b8ac20e33d42b",
      "text": "没事吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b596d3d8ecb410312aaaf032188f72893554dffb14266742f031acc8b0ecec8",
      "text": "啊哈哈，没事！\n刚才挡着视线没看清前面，被绊倒了而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa119b93f3f7c1f7ef42bf8ecbd90e827f138e138e18dd6b1043e50c42a2730",
      "text": "箱子里的东西也没事，\n这次应该不用写检讨报告了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ead358370ab865d7a232b1828e6cd5a2df996d8f365410121359502029821b1",
      "text": "那样就好，不过你多注意点啊？\n你平时就老是碰上倒霉事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efbc1450880aa4e07881ca1b48a75ab24127ce40c70713d90af969e3c6b5570a",
      "text": "好的，谢谢你的关心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e75e5a630b0accc7a3ed6066ca0afab85d5b57c486f516a5a7cb7691b475fb54",
      "text": "喂，全员集合！\n先把那个放下，赶紧回来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be03c29a1bada4569be09ff4595d4e096ce67966c67240abda72a31d9c8dc2e4",
      "text": "收到！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000077:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df246cc12d466a85f3c8d75af5bc15ea36ae84d81d319f61b6a6754bd211416d",
      "text": "担任一日消防局长的偶像要来？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f47ed7dab1607fb3cd6ff181c68d2c8cbdb91086ea92dec783a671a459b7a1e",
      "text": "没错。由我们负责接待。\n大家都打起精神来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8cf439d9a861e9b4089d31d64b234fda96d22c923eee275e75be1d4b28743f7",
      "text": "既有采访的摄像机，偶像的粉丝也来了啊。\n人真多啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:388b28468d503e56e42ff26a4797e344662f523c8b15dcc688462855591e5b0e",
      "text": "今天请多关照～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2212cd06cff6c55e3145e199b76337baf7c9a72b56f215004b7a8758c19f4280",
      "text": "呜哦哦哦，亚希酱——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e573a3dd5abc621ae8f6e0a1c4d5aa3750930a918549c3b50af47a089441afe",
      "text": "请、请不要推挤，\n别推……哇啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68329b8e2cae1c7ff582ba788733420db510e95083606af857b804f350b4e7b9",
      "text": "（得、得做好护身倒地才行！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61ed774b5542fef5ce566d0affb8f2c6ea4d21d06916d3e261fc94b94a080ad1",
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿……亚希酱～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b2d75988ba838ff3d90057a5bba84378bdeaffaa2f47398f5746fbbb75dfe64",
      "text": "哎？……呀、呀啊啊啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:727e62835cf85acd6ee3cb4533e1000dc5f6b60ad853ec12a7a268702dfea294",
      "text": "好！今天转得很顺……等等，哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9833f0fb7751c57a8421373ad2eec0b0fabb0dd33dbf6ca9d2e28e40a41d2d33",
      "text": "（我、我踢到了什么吗……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae70eb53ef49532115d9b13696f73f2bc2156688f9a499192d8678543185535b",
      "text": "大哥，你救了我吗！？\n谢谢你～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61df3cb9d26582e0039d4dc20fe83159ff2f424dd15d148684be68064c6c28e5",
      "text": "哎……？我、我吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ba8b2ebe266fdb8725cf677e6f54e236c7b2c5fd9f5d3b99b3b538bf1147bcd",
      "text": "（我护身倒地时顺势使出回旋踢的身影，\n似乎被前来采访的摄像机拍了下来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc162b6aee121e0e1d5f3e8163bacc08545bbea22c8729c749562c562cfe58ea",
      "text": "（虽然那个偶像小姑娘很感谢我，\n但看了电视的人们却……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f60e7e319d6e67abb2c674cf95cbbd4d0cdcf7cf83e58a1281a8f7dcade0ed4f",
      "text": "……这封信里写的是“暴力消防员”啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa6c6a1c9654ba4c990ea417b31010e19b6fb58be621ee83192140ef1e84f1f5",
      "text": "木村……别放在心上啊，这种信件。\n而且，那只是碰巧吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57781352b13b20571f815f7fb13b25a9c439db5fe7f989c3079ac6b38fda8484",
      "text": "大家心里都清楚你没有恶意。\n所以，别那么沮丧啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3c7c34b4b0098088886590240e78f6dc900a47e92a6832eb922ddbd6918df7c",
      "text": "……但我不想再给大家添更多麻烦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4004969e100d3f8730e689f8be9dc2a69da5b18a508dd87352b6150c4b5bdb33",
      "text": "怎么叫添麻烦……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b33d6d778c8e1bf74adc52305b1674e2e0e0c97b0eae7c131b90b3dd592e87b",
      "text": "没事啦。谢谢你们替我说话。\n能和大家一起工作，我很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f91200c07fa68c5e6a6093ee52a9bc287a5e59dd80f8d298fe4f16e47cf77b5",
      "text": "我……虽然很想成为日本第一的消防员，\n但也实在没办法了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf1f477a23f8e322077324d0bc473b7b130e99508adff9a3516cb789978285e0",
      "text": "一直以来，承蒙大家照顾了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e719d68d93cfeef0d9247452def7fd56dadfe8b786bf9445789a77175987761",
      "text": "木村，这些信该怎么处理……？\n全都扔掉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bfdddafd9cb7d23361bd8b9efac45faa6abf2c0b07ea613a8f33193095f570f",
      "text": "不，我会好好读完的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30eba9ed832f2d44b8bb1b197e6c8b8fc540ad610403e2616a06450fb5327ae4",
      "text": "这样啊……\n那弄完之后叫我一声吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b9be25fbdef5db338fd8faf54cc3b5cacb419c8cddc6c70a9ba69abaeb70cc9",
      "text": "……\n好，全部看一遍吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87018aaf945267e49862fa5fa113520dbb4e781c0225c992c38183838c4928e7",
      "text": "虽然是理所当然的，但真的被训得好惨啊。\n啊。不过，这封是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b79d33a2668121c1b7d8d4ddfe875ce0ecf0c01235c5d0e9a3e731a9e50e758",
      "text": "写着“支持你”。哈哈，好高兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29208e3f786803c8d0dd3abea4edf54846e207dfcdf88a025b98de659025bd6a",
      "text": "这边可爱的信纸是……\n亚希，是那个偶像小姑娘寄来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ce761e75399e4898bb834745741ac31d922f2d19f0accdc502567e58060caf",
      "text": "“非常感谢”……吗。\n这样啊，能帮上别人的忙，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:700f4f637bc9835b1253b346d76f542a66c069b3519fc3314cadf7ada3ac1f13",
      "text": "这封和那些鼓励的信，必须好好保存起来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_g:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aceaefc7447d4bbd9fa4ce08faa54aed9e4260cfbff7bce0239a7d985b097c14",
      "text": "这边的是什么呢。\n信件、传单？还有……联系方式？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6886ff2a9bd904cc220d9d04ab39f18042f976b92677ca4e53578dc39dee58f7",
      "text": "“偶像试镜”……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed52f4729747ea20d4ee9766ed6f154f3e1d04cdb79c88ea70696b529c8a57c",
      "text": "“在电视上看到了您的活跃表现。\n话说，您想成为偶像吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:093c56dbdaee5b258a75fdd563f4c66a095001cbf152367ad487720eb87edb4e",
      "text": "……写着什么呢。“演唱会、与粉丝交流、\n电视节目录制、一日消防署长”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adba4158eec023b3ddb1f749575a685fc81bc7c87d0b2ac06e9d4ea662a8b7a4",
      "text": "……消防署长！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67a7ad0d6ece8542338a9197096cbfad6b566b06f8bd60c19f50f6ef5300acd6",
      "text": "说起来，那个偶像小姑娘\n也是一日消防署长来着……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41f3adf47590a07536252f7ac732bb17d9a51457dbe89e01dc3bbdbdf459fc6f",
      "text": "对啊！\n还、还有这个办法啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2bc4fbabaa65a131d728a79db3c3c978c75279b72f837cdeadca859217c67ff",
      "text": "成为偶像的话，就能当上消防署长！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a0165d04e294bd23b1a086cf4d6d4d3a03af688dab2cb7309ea58443c65ace2",
      "text": "说不定就能成为我所追求的日本第一消防员了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ed6124c8f8080b2e1a36fc2e2741a69bb4aa0b938f7c3f8d25d0d66ce773318",
      "text": "（本以为辞掉消防员后就只能放弃了。\n但是，其实还没必要放弃啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f416ead7249fc4627b6c92b526e679286e39a87a0f2c538692d953fbffe8b9c8",
      "text": "哪怕只有一毫米的可能性能实现……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faf42299371f40b58c0b2bac9156e9073f90b4dae51b8803077e149b3cf74cf6",
      "text": "我也只能去挑战偶像这条路了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f1b963391899ccebfcc21971cd47124a3bd2f636a614d27465541740e84e6d2",
      "text": "总之，先打这个联系方式上的电话试试吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a24af93c2a707e93e743055e5056f2e404539b83dde153f235efa32988d8bc13",
      "text": "……事情就是这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b95794641049383d456cbf93ce04c6fbd04703fd9fd9b4da90e87f6ab6f27ce9",
      "text": "原来如此，真不容易啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09ec48ea37b340da034784f9bf82fdc8f63d5a1f91ce2fb044f2f165f21e9b21",
      "text": "哪里，虽然不得不辞掉了工作，\n但我并没有放弃梦想！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2986a5f813374093ba1d2cc616c7ccd99f9a4b5a3f57530ebacc5db0b269a6e2",
      "text": "我绝对要成为偶像，当上消防署长……\n然后，也要成为日本第一的消防员给你们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ca1e4c5c61c7c2ab46960dd9680f31efa567dacd0a29abbd91a8ef5af999272",
      "text": "哈哈，这股干劲真不错。\n我不讨厌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cfee3d7286049c07cf46c941babe0198041558562dd35186961e8efbbdbc7d5",
      "text": "说起来，两位为什么会在这里？\n诚司先生之前不是自卫官吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb1b79d53e1fd9f7697077f1c0f33b177d45696f2220ddfbe928556acdb92fde",
      "text": "嗯，我这边也是事出有因。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df74a4aed9aa233f110877ea6f36c28b50e9a41cd4893225f3e060e6fc04ac56",
      "text": "我也算是事出有因吧……我有成为偶像之后\n想做的事情。就跟龙一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54607bdb1274a3d8d17dc9423dd7fe454b5d17bdc5997c7f5767ae4b75bdd92b",
      "text": "话说回来，前消防员、前自卫官再加上前警察吗。\n这阵容还真够硬核的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cd5fc8b75d8c006b37f5d02a79097e40b179b84c3802ff1a4a4d19f131d6b83",
      "text": "英雄先生，您以前是警察吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_i:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:601365f6080d62d992fe841346489ba432f80d4fa5a9a286ff754fb1f955a1a2",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈。\n这或许也算是一种奇妙的缘分吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6ad8d2c3427535f92ade5eb6c1f43c3aad6371100524e564f9107b59481d608",
      "text": "虽然发生了各种各样的事，但能来这里真是太好了。\n不仅如此，还能像这样和诚司先生重逢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6902dd31349e6bc56a52cebf2a554c6bdc475a01825f7e7cb3c9efde2079ef26",
      "text": "是啊，我也很高兴能遇见龙和英雄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12b48a7ff73b4b16ba877946a3f9260762b30f25fbb1e30e325e0ec16ae4e766",
      "text": "嗯。多亏跟你们聊了会儿，我的紧张感也消除了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:576b7c54031bd41277bab4b4e88a60d44e674f3c1fbba5a2a299cf082577f635",
      "text": "各位，试镜马上就要开始了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70fc4074007175944c8697f7569bb3ac13ecfbb36891dffabca8552051d8518f",
      "text": "被叫到名字的各位，请按顺序\n移步到这个房间里来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e61214e4402c3702daa0f326296076536d1f7937bbeeaecd3c6e6bd898c386e8",
      "text": "看来要开始了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:394bef015cd102d20bdfe8654bbaaa8d308c56487a61f87fe6e0961ad5bf971f",
      "text": "我好像又开始紧张起来了。\n希望别出什么乱子才好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43b03fd20625e7c68f3262969c9d80e8e447e982674666498d8f75334899c000",
      "text": "没事的。\n别太紧绷，放轻松去面对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e483e70c5d286d3e7eaae873379c2cb926e3a1e1a8995c7d5f2d33539f19cc8",
      "text": "没错，龙。\n你不是要成为日本第一的消防员吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f4245073bd454566bb557c38e50e45f780f1ab42f0064fb4deae6ad97472e34",
      "text": "我们互相加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_02_1_1_006_02:1_1_006_02_j:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8fbffdc5bea3b6a1a8880c2ac2a34b75cb8d858807d837e86c152c6fea63a29",
      "text": "是、是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
